<Page title="Cookie policy" section="Legal" path="/cookies/" description="The Emirates Guide does not set cookies or store anything on your device, so there is no cookie banner." sources={[{ title: 'UK Information Commissioner’s Office: Cookies and similar technologies', url: 'https://ico.org.uk/for-organisations/direct-marketing-and-privacy-and-electronic-communications/guide-to-pecr/cookies-and-similar-technologies/' }]}>
  <h2>The short version</h2>
  <p>The Emirates Guide does not set cookies and does not store anything on your device. You will not see a cookie banner here because there is nothing to consent to.</p>
  <h2>Other storage</h2>
  <p>This site does not use local storage, session storage, fingerprinting scripts, advertising pixels, analytics or social media plugins. Fonts and images are served from our own domain.</p>
  <h2>Sites we link to</h2>
  <p>Official sources and the Tourground directory are on other websites, with their own cookie policies, which apply when you visit them.</p>
  <h2>If this changes</h2>
  <p>If we ever add a cookie or similar technology that is not strictly necessary, we will ask for your consent first where the law requires it, and update this page.</p>
</Page>
